[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4081.47, "timestamp": "01:08:01", "text": "嗯，還有什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4083.87, "timestamp": "01:08:03", "text": "？  為什麼我現在腦子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4085.15, "timestamp": "01:08:05", "text": "一片空白？  是啊，那裡面有這個"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4087.112, "timestamp": "01:08:07", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "anyhow is it actually really clean there ?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4090.19, "timestamp": "01:08:10", "text": "，那還有什麼呢？別管我，我只是在調整麥克風。  我買了一個超薄麥克風支架，所以非常好用。我用在日本做兼職的第一份薪水買下了它。所以真的很不錯。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4097.884, "timestamp": "01:08:17", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "what are ya going to do going forward now ?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4103.15, "timestamp": "01:08:23", "text": "我可以調整麥克風之類的。我以前……你還記得我去年生日直播的時候嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4109.51, "timestamp": "01:08:29", "text": "？我用的是那種鵝頸式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4123.23, "timestamp": "01:08:43", "text": "麥克風支架，對吧？為了在我展示生日蛋糕之類的東西時放置我的相機"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4124.564, "timestamp": "01:08:44", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "found new senpai in work space caring kind ?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4127.95, "timestamp": "01:08:47", "text": "。  [音樂] 是的。  我一直用它搭配我從印度帶來的麥克風。還是那款Fifine"}]